                <li><b>Class Selection:</b> Coach is the budget-friendly option, while Sleeper accommodations provide private rooms, beds, and included meals at a significantly higher price - typically reserved for longer segments of the Floridian route.</li>
                <li><b>Time of Travel:</b> Weekend departures, holiday periods, and trains during theme park peak seasons (summer, spring break, holidays) may have higher fares and limited availability.</li>
